Subject: Retarget OpenSpeedTest nginx roots to the package-owned document tree

Origin: DHI-internal (DHI packaging layout)
Description: Point both OpenSpeedTest nginx root directives at the FHS
 docroot /usr/share/openspeedtest/ instead of /usr/share/nginx/html/, which
 the catalog nginx-stable package owns. Certificate paths stay /etc/ssl/nginx.crt
 and /etc/ssl/nginx.key.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/openspeedtest/Docker-Image.git 293b8d77de801dfaa8f8c38f0233f9dec032fe45
Verify: test files/OpenSpeedTest-Server.conf
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI packaging layout only)
Drop-When: never: the package document root must remain separate from nginx-owned files

--- a/files/OpenSpeedTest-Server.conf
+++ b/files/OpenSpeedTest-Server.conf
@@ -26 +26 @@
-        root /usr/share/nginx/html/;
+        root /usr/share/openspeedtest/;
@@ -47 +47 @@
-            root /usr/share/nginx/html/;
+            root /usr/share/openspeedtest/;
